# path flow name state_id
# The ragged shape of twotriangles_ragged_branches.tree, on the state network: module 1
# holds its state nodes directly while module 2 holds sub-modules. States 1 and 4 are
# both physical node 1 and share module 1, so MemCorrection's physical-node codebook is
# actually engaged -- the leaf-module rate it charges F at differs between L and L*,
# which is what makes this worth having next to the plain undirected case.
1:1 0.1 "a" 1
1:2 0.1 "d" 4
1:3 0.1 "b" 2
2:1:1 0.1 "c" 3
2:1:2 0.1 "e" 5
2:2:1 0.1 "f" 6
